{"id":"828452ef97907ed6","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-m-complete-maximal.md","title":"M-Complete Maximal","display":"lem-m-complete-maximal — M-Complete Maximal","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-m-complete-maximal","aliases":["92-lem-m-complete-maximal"],"display":"lem-m-complete-maximal — M-Complete Maximal","depends_on":["[[92-df-m-complete]]","[[92-df-many-one-reducible]]","[[92-df-ce-set]]","[[92-df-halting-set]]","[[92-thm-halting-undecidable]]"],"source":"本地递归论定义展开；非本书正文结果","source_status":"本地扩展；定义展开"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-m-complete-maximal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-m-complete-maximal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-m-complete-maximal — M-Complete Maximal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" href=\"?note=9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" title=\"92-df-m-complete\">92-df-m-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5b356f91d7193d28\" href=\"?note=5b356f91d7193d28\" title=\"92-df-many-one-reducible\">92-df-many-one-reducible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8665bbc504ca9fb6\" href=\"?note=8665bbc504ca9fb6\" title=\"92-thm-halting-undecidable\">92-thm-halting-undecidable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地递归论定义展开；非本书正文结果"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地扩展；定义展开"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" href=\"?note=9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" title=\"92-df-m-complete\">92-df-m-complete</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(B \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{MComplete}\\)</span> (many-one completeness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" href=\"?note=9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" title=\"92-df-m-complete\">92-df-m-complete</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> (computably enumerable predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete\\text{-}maximal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\Longrightarrow B\\leq_m A\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete\\text{-}maximal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\Longrightarrow B\\leq_m A\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多一完全集在c.e.集的多一度预序中处于最大（最难）等价类；这不表示有唯一的最大集合</li>\n<li>所有r.e.集可归约到多一完全集</li>\n<li>多一完全集是最&quot;困难&quot;的r.e.集</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>多一完全，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>不可判定（因为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>不可判定且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K \\leq_m A\">\\(K \\leq_m A\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>多一完全性提供了不可判定的&quot;最强&quot;证明</li>\n<li>反向蕴涵正是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" href=\"?note=9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" title=\"92-df-m-complete\">92-df-m-complete</a>中的定义展开</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>主断言展开 many-one 完全性的定义。它与原书的不完备性主题相关，但此 PDF 不提供本节点的独立出处。修复了字面反斜杠 b 被损坏为 U+0008 的控制字符，使 bigl 重新成为合法 TeX 命令。</p>\n<p>原书定位：本地递归论定义展开；非本书正文结果。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-m-complete","status":"resolved","id":"9f063fb5c2ee3d66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-m-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-many-one-reducible","status":"resolved","id":"5b356f91d7193d28","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-many-one-reducible]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-halting-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-halting-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"8665bbc504ca9fb6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-halting-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-m-complete","status":"resolved","id":"9f063fb5c2ee3d66","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}$ (set parameter, see [[92-df-m-complete]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-m-complete","status":"resolved","id":"9f063fb5c2ee3d66","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MComplete}$ (many-one completeness predicate, see [[92-df-m-complete]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably enumerable predicate, see [[92-df-ce-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-m-complete","status":"resolved","id":"9f063fb5c2ee3d66","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"反向蕴涵正是[[92-df-m-complete]]中的定义展开","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"B \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete\\text{-}maximal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{CE}(B)\\Longrightarrow B\\leq_m A\\bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K \\leq_m A","display":false}],"bytes":1782,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-239","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-m-complete-maximal]]"}],"outgoing":["9f063fb5c2ee3d66","5b356f91d7193d28","69a2a133da01f9c9","06a154edf19ea063","8665bbc504ca9fb6"]}